  "vibe": "A pastel parlor built on pink-cream #fdeff2 with a hot pink #f25d9c that takes whole frames — the Statement beat flips to solid pink with cream type at 150px, and the CTA drops to plum-ink #33202a. Titan One's fat rounded caps sit over Varela Round. The backdrop is a candy counter: twelve sprinkles in pink, mint and waffle-tan tumble down the frame end over end while a waffle cone with a pink scoop, a white gloss dot and a scalloped drip edge parks in the upper right — a pink drip falls from it on a loop and a cherry bobs on a green stem. Titles land with an outBack bounce, items pop, and the camera hops, spins and drops with the widest drift here. Freezer levels read on a thermometer tube; lab switches flip; the tasting counter gets clicked through.",
